config ZMK_BLE_EXCLUSIVE_PROFILE
    bool "Keep only the active Bluetooth profile connected"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_BLE && (!ZMK_SPLIT || ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL)
    help
      ZMK keeps every previously connected host connected after a profile switch.
      Several live host links compete with the split link for radio time and make
      the keyboard and trackball lag. This disconnects every non-active profile once
      the active profile is connected.
